   196→        title: Cascade Status Updates
   197→        type: requirement
   198→        tags:
   199→          - dx
   200→          - cli
   201→        description: When updating a parent item's implementation status, CLI offers to cascade the update
   202→          to nested children. Prevents status drift between parent features and child requirements.
   203→        depends_on: []
   204→        implements: []
   205→        relates_to: []
   206→        tests: []
   207→        created: 2026-01-16T13:52:53.609Z
   208→        acceptance_criteria:
   209→          - id: ac-1
   210→            given: A parent item has children and user runs 'kspec item set @parent --implementation
   211→              implemented'
   212→            when: The command completes
   213→            then: "CLI prompts: 'Update N child items to implemented? [y/n]'"
   214→          - id: ac-2
   215→            given: A parent item has children, user runs 'kspec item set @parent --implementation implemented',
   216→              and user responds 'y' to the cascade prompt
   217→            when: The cascade is accepted
   218→            then: All child items are updated to 'implemented' and each child update is logged
   219→          - id: ac-3
   220→            given: A parent item has children, user runs 'kspec item set @parent --implementation implemented',
   221→              and user responds 'n' to the cascade prompt
   222→            when: The cascade is rejected
   223→            then: Child items are NOT updated and retain their original status
   224→          - id: ac-4
   225→            given: A parent item has children and user runs 'kspec item set @parent --implementation implemented
   226→              --json'
   227→            when: JSON mode is active
   228→            then: No cascade prompt is shown and children are NOT automatically updated
   229→          - id: ac-5
   230→            given: A parent item has NO children and user runs 'kspec item set @parent --implementation
   231→              implemented'
   232→            when: The update completes
   233→            then: No cascade prompt is shown (since there are no children to cascade to)
   234→        status:
